From: Mangue OS <noreply@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] riscv: dts: allwinner: build MangoPi MQ Pro DTB with overlay symbols

Header-peripheral overlays (fdtoverlays in extlinux.conf) need __symbols__
in the base DTB.

---
 arch/riscv/boot/dts/allwinner/Makefile | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/riscv/boot/dts/allwinner/Makefile b/arch/riscv/boot/dts/allwinner/Makefile
--- a/arch/riscv/boot/dts/allwinner/Makefile
+++ b/arch/riscv/boot/dts/allwinner/Makefile
@@ -1,4 +1,5 @@
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
+DTC_FLAGS_sun20i-d1-mangopi-mq-pro := -@
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_SUNXI) += sun20i-d1-clockworkpi-v3.14.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_SUNXI) += sun20i-d1-devterm-v3.14.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_SUNXI) += sun20i-d1-dongshan-nezha-stu.dtb
